            </note>
            <note corresp="#d151-f2" n="1" xml:id="d151-f2-content">
                <p>Instructions to and reports from USUN are in Department of State, Central File
                    POL 27 YEMEN.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d151-f3" n="2" xml:id="d151-f3-content">
                <p>The Embassy in London transmitted to the Department of State in airgram A–1858,
                    February 19, a memorandum of Talbot’s conversation with Deputy Under Secretary
                    Sir Roger Stevens that took place in London on February 6. (Ibid.) For text, see
                    the Supplement, the regional compilation.</p>
            </note>
